# Simplex Optimization of Yield of sec-Butylbenzene in a Friedel-Crafts Alkylation: A Special Undergraduate Project in Analytical Chemistry.

**Authors:** Amenta, D. S., And Others

## Abstract
An experiment is described in which undergraduate students can optimize the relative yield of sec-butylbenzene by varying molar ratio and temperature. (Author/SA)

